id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":283518733,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyODM1MTg3MzM=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/usability","name":"usability","color":"447744","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/26","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/26","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/26/labels","id":16503691,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A-9OL","number":26,"title":"4.9","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":50,"closed_issues":0,"state":"open","created_at":"2026-06-24T20:03:09Z","updated_at":"2026-10-21T15:30:45Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":8,"created_at":"2024-11-02T03:20:35Z","updated_at":"2026-09-28T15:54:50Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/98749","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98749","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98749.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98749.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"_This is an updated and slightly simplified PR from 2024, now compatible with Godot 4.8._\r\n\r\nCurrently, some controls are visible even though they do not contribute to the environment, which is confusing for users who are trying to change their values and are not seeing any changes in the visuals.\r\n\r\nFor example, the default environment view shows Ambient Light Color and Ambient Light Energy, even though they are doing nothing because 'Ambient Light' is set to 'Background' which is 'Clear Color'.\r\n\r\n<img width=\"629\" height=\"341\" alt=\"wrong1\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/423daba0-21b0-42a8-b921-d976810a4eeb\" />\r\n\r\nAnother example, when 'Ambient Light' is changed to 'Color', redundant color picker for 'Color' is displayed in the 'Background', but it shouldn't be when 'Clear Color' is selected.\r\n\r\n<img width=\"630\" height=\"374\" alt=\"wrong2\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7ccec273-a328-488c-90dc-92d88369a2c4\" />\r\n\r\nI have updated the `Environment::_validate_property` function so that it correctly hides the controls in the inspector depending on the options selected.\r\n\r\nHiding the controls in the editor doesn't affect their values, it's just a UI thing for not showing elements that are not contributing to the environment.\r\n\r\nChanges:\r\n\r\n- `background_color` is visible **only** if `bg_mode` is `BG_COLOR`\r\n- `ambient_light_color` and `ambient_light_energy` are visible when (one of below):\r\n    - `ambient_source` is `AMBIENT_SOURCE_BG` and `bg_mode` is `BG_SKY`\r\n    - `ambient_source` is `AMBIENT_SOURCE_SKY`\r\n    - `ambient_source` is `AMBIENT_SOURCE_COLOR`\r\n- `ambient_light_sky_contribution` is visible when (one of below):\r\n    - `ambient_source` is `AMBIENT_SOURCE_BG` and `bg_mode` is `BG_SKY`\r\n    - `ambient_source` is `AMBIENT_SOURCE_SKY`\r\n\r\n| before | after |\r\n| - | - |\r\n| <img width=\"595\" height=\"628\" alt=\"bef1\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7fc8a652-e613-4a3d-b7b9-9fc5d011e3a3\" /> | <img width=\"579\" height=\"565\" alt=\"aft1\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f8193e60-7353-4619-9a70-75521d8f9d5b\" /> |\r\n| <img width=\"580\" height=\"660\" alt=\"bef2\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0811b4cf-ffc5-4a96-93ea-b85ecd110074\" /> | <img width=\"570\" height=\"629\" alt=\"aft2\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1578a836-95aa-4d2a-90ec-d616c4e0c9af\" /> |\r\n| <img width=\"595\" height=\"624\" alt=\"bef3\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/728dd80c-6b63-4e4b-84de-cb950a631d8f\" /> | <img width=\"564\" height=\"591\" alt=\"aft3\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/50f2789a-4c0d-419f-8344-be7e39ea2ebb\" /> |\r\n","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98749/reactions","total_count":7,"+1":7,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98749/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}